# Accelerometer mount matrix: flip X and Y (180 deg about Z).
# iio-sensor-proxy consumes the accelerometer through the tb322fc-gyro-bridge
# uinput device (the "input-accel" driver): the bridge holds the SSC
# accelerometer exclusively, and we deliberately do not advertise `ssc-accel`
# on fastrpc-adsp* (see packages/iio-sensor-proxy-y700), so the daemon always
# picks the input device. The SUBSYSTEM=="input" line is therefore the one that
# takes effect - drv-input-accel reads ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX from the input device.
# The fastrpc line is kept as a fallback for the SSC path; it only applies if
# `ssc-accel` is ever advertised on that device again.
ACTION=="add|change", KERNEL=="fastrpc-adsp*", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="-1, 0, 0; 0, -1, 0; 0, 0, 1"
ACTION=="add|change", SUBSYSTEM=="input", ATTRS{name}=="Lenovo Legion Y700 Motion Sensors", ENV{ACCEL_MOUNT_MATRIX}="-1, 0, 0; 0, -1, 0; 0, 0, 1"
